    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This three-bedroomed home is located just off the Kimmage Road Lr., close to shops, schools, various bus routes and much more. Something of a project, this property has huge potential to be reimagined as a modern, comfortable, family home.\r\n\r\nEXPLORE INSIDE\r\n\r\nThe footprint of this home is untouched since it was first constructed and the layout reflects an older style of living. From the hall there are doors accessing the sitting room to the front of the house, and a dining room and fitted kitchen to the rear. Rooms are spacious and there is ample light reaching all parts of the house. \r\n\r\nUpstairs there are three bedrooms, two with wardrobes, and a family bathroom. \r\n\r\nThis property needs significant updating and renovation, but the location is exceptional and there is potential to extend, subject to planning permission. \r\n\r\nEXPLORE OUTSIDE\r\n\r\nOutside there is a south-facing rear garden with huge potential just waiting to be realised. The front garden offers the possibility of copying many local properties by adding a driveway for off-street parking, subject to planning permission. \r\nThis home is well located with many facilities on the doorstep, including a convenient Tesco Express just a few metres around the corner. The shops at Sundrive and KCR are both easily accessed, and bus routes will transport you to the City Centre in about half an hour. The nearby S4 bus route provides direct connectivity to Terenure, Rathgar and onwards to UCD Belfield. \r\n\r\nTHE BOTTOM LINE\r\n\r\nThis is a well-located substantial home that, with imagination and work, has strong forever-home vibes, we expect a lot of interest."
      },
